mapping_examples:
Tier mapping examples (illustrative):
- Tier: Commit-2 (2x A10 equivalent) => reserved_pool: {pool_size: 2, prewarm_count: 1, burst_window_seconds: 120, isolation: 'soft', preemptible_allowed: false}
- Tier: Commit-8 (8x A100 equivalent) => reserved_pool: {pool_size: 8, prewarm_count: 2, burst_window_seconds: 300, isolation: 'strong', preemptible_allowed: false, headroom: 10%}
- Tier: Flex-4 (discounted flex commit) => reserved_pool: {pool_size: 4, prewarm_count: 0, burst_window_seconds: 60, isolation: 'soft', preemptible_allowed: true}
